WEBVTT

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.310
Kill her? Noel?

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.360
Let that masked idiot kill her.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.450
Is that what you just said, Rachel?

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:15.530
Don't make us say it.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:20.620
Shit sucks, but with what she's become, there's no bringing her back.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.210
Kokonoe, you crazy bitch...

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.290
Noel Vermillion is now a completely different person.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.880
Even so, there's got to be a way to save her, right?

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:31.960
Rachel!

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:36.300
I am no god.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:36.930
Damn!

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:41.220
Y'all always acting so arrogant and patronizing...

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:45.640
And yet none of you can save even one foolish girl?!

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.070
Answer me one thing.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.740
What'll happen if she goes into the Cauldron?

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.910
This world will end.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:01.660
Huh?

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:05.000
Right now, she exists to destroy the world.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.330
That is the sole purpose of her existence.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:19.930
The Dark One?

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.390
You're late, Brother.

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.480
Yeah, I was hanging out at the edge of the fight, watching you get beat up.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:29.810
You're a terrible person, Brother.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.770
Let's wrap this up quick.

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:33.400
That goes without saying.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.660
Target in possession of the Azure Grimoire.

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:38.660
Noel...

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.580
How could you let yourself be reduced to this crazy, messed up machine!

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.330
You dumbass!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:19.590
Rebel 12: The Price for the Future

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.420
I hate...

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.090
Rebel 12: The Price for the Future

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:22.890
I hate this world.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:31.390
Jin!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.650
Kusanagi? The God-Killer Sword?

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.690
Get real!

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.450
You're Noel Vermillion, aren't you?!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:45.660
Target's mental wavelength: unknown, unknown, unknown...

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:48.740
I'll turn that useless armor into scraps!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.910
Mark my words, you numskull!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:07.930
Damn!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:20.650
Perish.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:25.200
Jin!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.370
Brother!

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.720
Destroy the world?

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:48.970
That's not even funny.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:50.890
We're talking about Noel here.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.640
Noel observed the endless malice of this world

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.770
and, having lost hope, she ceased to exist.

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:01.860
Put an end to this before the worst can come to pass.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.700
The Grimoire in your possession has the power to do that.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.870
If the Azure Grimoire's original form is indeed the Cauldron,

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.990
it should be capable of shattering her soul from within.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.790
If you can't bring yourself to do it, then—

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.130
Don't let Mr. Superhero interfere.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:20.960
Just watch, I'll handle this myself somehow.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.430
Are you fine with this, harlequin?

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:30.220
If they're defeated, you know what to do.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.140
Of course.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.230
Arrows of Heaven!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:40.860
Wisdom of the Divines!

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:45.900
You idiot!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:51.280
You're too hurt to carry on!

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.490
Get back to the sidelines and sit tight!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.960
You've got to be kidding! I can still keep going!

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:00.830
Filled with suffering, sorrow, and rage,

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.880
with hope only to be lost over and over again...

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.800
I don't need a world like that.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.260
All is a lie. All is an illusion.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.050
The end has come.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.350
Wh-What's that?

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:16.810
I hate...

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:21.310
The world hates me...

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.860
Stand back, Jin!

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:23.940
Brother?!

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.400
Now. The destruction of all.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.050
Ragna...

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.770
You know, Noel...

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:09.610
Survival of target confirmed. Proceeding with elimination.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:25.090
I gave you a lot of shit about being an idiot and stuff,
but actually, the way you're always kind...

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:28.550
Your plain and honest ways...

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:31.760
I appreciate that about you.

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:35.800
You've lost hope?

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.020
That's fucking stupid.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:41.520
Hope's the one thing you can never lose!

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.520
If you saw the malice in this world,

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.730
you must've seen its opposite too, right?

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.530
I've only met you a couple days ago,

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.200
but I don't regret the time we spent together.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.410
It's no use. The personality known as Noel is no longer there.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.410
Hey, Noel, think back and remember!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.870
Even if only the people around you...

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.170
They're not a lost cause, right?

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.130
I am a doll.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:09.800
Not human.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.630
A doll that will destroy this world.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.430
I hate. I hate, I hate...

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.430
I hate this world, and everything!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:19.470
Shut up!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.810
So what?!

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.560
It doesn't matter whether you were created naturally or not.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.060
You're... You're still human!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.440
You're Noel Vermillion!

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:33.990
Noel!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.000
<i>What do I do?!</i>

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.540
Ragna...

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.210
The Idea Engine!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.640
Lambda, I'm going to use your life!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:01.390
Idea Engine, reverse connection!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.350
Are you kidding me?!

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.240
Snap the hell out of it already!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.500
Don't you run away!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.960
You have to carve your own destiny, Noel!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.340
I heard you.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:40.760
When you cried out for help that time.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:54.530
To think Ragna the Bloodedge has defeated the Eye...

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:57.700
Yeah, that was a very interesting event.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.700
He even defeated the serpent.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:03.830
However, this is not the future that we wished for.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:06.660
This will impede the process that will take us to the Day of Ruin.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:12.880
But if Noel Vermillion loses her powers, we can inherit the Azure.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.840
Affirmative. Noel Vermillion is an uncertain factor.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:21.300
Let us excise this one event and inherit the Azure for ourselves.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:22.470
Agreed.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:25.390
We've failed to destroy the Master Unit,

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.640
but as long as we have the Azure, the rest can be ironed out.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.770
But before we do that...

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:32.310
It will be necessary to eliminate the singularity.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.320
Affirmative.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.940
Then, with regard to Yuuki Terumi, we will conduct the reinitialization.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.490
Man, someone call the interior design hotline!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.330
You! How did you get in here?!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:49.920
Boy, has Rags been proving himself useful to me.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.960
I ought to buy him a drink sometime.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.220
In all the possible outcomes, <i>this</i> was the only time.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.470
In this one moment,

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.970
for just the few nanoseconds it took Ragsy to defeat Kusanagi,

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.970
you guys <i>looked away</i>.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.140
Impossible... That is beyond our comprehension.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:14.110
Right, now that I'm in charge, we'll be heading straight for the Day of Ruin,

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.230
so why don't you guy go just take a hike?

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.110
Don't do this.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.950
Now that Noel Vermillion has lost her powers,

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.910
you can no longer exist, either.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.820
Thanks for the heads up. I hadn't noticed.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:26.830
But, really, you don't have to worry about me going anywhere.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.910
You cannot mean that you have awakened <i>her</i>?

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:33.420
Bingo! That is correct!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.380
And your prize is...

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.760
...a home-brewed virus made by none other than our very own Phantom!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:45.050
Affirmative. Danger. Danger.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:47.140
Danger. Danger.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:51.100
It's chock-full of numerical formulas you guys have never even heard about,

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:54.060
so I hope you brought some extra batteries for your calculators, kids!

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:57.270
Well, have fun with that.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.230
Mister Ragna...

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.190
Quit being so much trouble.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.740
I... I...

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.580
How could I have...

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.580
Sheesh, you idiot.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:03.380
Ragna.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:07.970
To draw back a soul that had fallen deep into the Boundary...

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:12.680
You really are a good-natured, dim-witted, dopey idiot.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:14.640
Brother!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.110
"Brother"?

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:23.570
Did you just call mister Ragna "Brother", Major Kisaragi?!

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.400
Second Lieutenant Vermillion...

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:26.780
You...

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:30.120
Do you really fully comprehend the situation we have on our hands?!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.920
Yeah, guess it's gone now.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:42.210
Well, I've got another one, so I guess I'll manage.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.340
That is not the issue here!

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:45.880
That is <i>not</i> it!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.220
You dumb jerk! Dimwit!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.930
Nincompoop! Idiot! Twit!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.890
Fool! Ass! Clown! Buffoon!

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:53.560
Mister Hero?

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.600
What have I to gain in putting down a cripple?

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.520
Thank you all for gathering here!

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.410
Terumi!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:17.290
Oh, dear, you look so fierce all of a sudden!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:21.000
I only came because I had news to report to you.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.920
To tell you the truth, you see,

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:27.220
I just went and incapacitated Takamagahara!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:33.720
You shouldn't be able to exist without being observed by Takamagahara.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:37.770
It's all thanks to my boy Rags here.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:41.770
Lil' Rags pranced around and howled like a puppy

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:45.610
but then he didn't finish all the food in his bowl like he was supposed to,

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:50.860
which, as I had planned, worked out perfectly for me!

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:51.990
It can't be...

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.700
But it can!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.240
All the events converge here!

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:58.290
It has all come together here!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:59.370
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:04.540
let's all give a big hand for Rags, the brave but dopey puppy!

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.130
Terumi!

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.170
So, given that...

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:11.340
You all can go die now!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.970
You fucking psychopath!

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:20.350
That's good! I like that look! It makes you worth killing!

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:23.770
Stop this, Hazama.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:24.360
What?

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.070
You are before Her Majesty.

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:29.780
Thou art raising a ruckus, Terumi.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.950
Well, well, well... This is embarrassing.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.120
I lost my head there in spite of myself.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:51.220
Saya!

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:15.030
Tsubaki!

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.580
Tsubaki, what are you doing here?!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.830
Tsubaki!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:25.080
The Imperator is my last light.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:29.250
Noel, our paths have already branched apart.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:32.720
Tsubaki...

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.970
You.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:41.310
What is the meaning of this?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:47.110
Takamagahara is already at my mercy.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.360
The Continuum Shift hath ended

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.320
and all possible events hath been established.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:56.110
Eternity shall bid welcome to its end

00:16:56.110 --> 00:17:00.080
and restore the world to its rightful form.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.660
I shall inaugurate the Day of Ruin.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.170
What the hell are you saying?!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.380
Rachel Alucard.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.840
Thine efforts hast been in vain this time.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.090
We'll have to see about that.

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:18.800
Aren't you the one getting ahead of yourself by claiming victory so early?

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:24.520
O Spectator, thou must already comprehend.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:32.280
Even then, I still have faith.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.400
Ye insects groveling upon the earth,

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.120
pay heed.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:43.240
A new age is about to dawn.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.180
Saya is the Imperator?

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.390
The NOL Imperator...

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.420
Mister Ragna...

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.420
Noel, you're finally up!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.560
Mister Ragna left, didn't he?

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.180
Do you want to go after him?

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.770
I wanted to thank him, but...

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:50.480
But...

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:54.320
I have a feeling I'll get to see him again.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.440
Let's go, Noel.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:03.240
The random phenomenon has shifted into a sequential phenomenon.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.700
Were you fine with how this turned out?

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:11.250
Takamagahara, a manufactured god, and a world that only proceeded in a way that was convenient to it.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.750
A never-ending destiny.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.800
As an Observer, I could do nothing

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:19.590
but watch this dull eternity.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.010
But the factor that the god scorned

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:26.310
and thought little of worked a miracle.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:31.640
Ragna the Bloodedge. And Noel Vermillion.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:38.480
Yes, the two moved the world and pushed time onto its next path.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:43.360
It looks like you've obtained the Power of Order.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:46.330
That is none of your business.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:51.830
If you ever want to learn about your power, come find me.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:53.710
You must be joking.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.630
What has changed is not the world.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:01.050
Ragna himself has changed. Noel's heart has changed.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:03.890
We saw it.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:07.560
Saw Ragna's Azure Grimoire touch Noel.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.730
Saw the moment the two Azures forged a new bond.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.850
Carve out your own destiny.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.860
The Dark One's own words?

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:19.860
What simple, childish words.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:23.450
But they are words that we could never utter.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:29.830
Ultimately, it seems you were never needed to the very end, mister Hero.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.700
It is not over yet.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:36.460
Thus far, everything has gone exactly as that bastard Yuuki Terumi intended.

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:37.540
Yes.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:42.420
Knowing that, you are going to leave them to their own devices?

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:45.180
The ones who will change the future isn't us.

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:46.300
Now, then, I'm going to head off.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.220
It's them.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.260
Now, then, I'm going to head off.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:48.890
Watch, for I will change it in my own way.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.310
To see the lmperator?

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.850
Watch, for I will change it in my own way.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:52.850
I have to go.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.060
My vow remains unchanged.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.270
The lmperator...

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.310
...is Saya, no question about it.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.620
Goodness, what a surprise!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.080
Your creation certainly does you credit.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:13.160
To reconstruct herself with nothing but sheer willpower!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:17.380
The Thirteenth Prime Field was the one closest to being perfect, after all.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.000
But still, this heartbeat...

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.260
Doesn't it give you a thrill somehow?

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.800
A coincidence or something inevitable?

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:27.180
Is this part of your plans, too, Hazama?

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.800
The Imperator said so herself, remember?

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.220
A new age has dawned.

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:36.600
Well, fine. Do as you please.

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:42.320
I see. So, you are the Sword of Izanagi.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:44.530
The world turns.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.030
Everything goes round and round.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:50.450
The never-ending conclusion has crumbled

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:54.040
and a new dawn has arrived.

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.410
What awaits us in the new world...

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:57.580
No one, not even I, knows that.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.710
But you know, Ragna...

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.210
Wait for meow, wait for meow, wait for meow!

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:08.340
Good Guy, I'm tagging along, 'kay?

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:10.550
Huh?! Why?!

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:14.060
The Cat Person told meow to follow you.

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:17.100
I'll be on your tail wherever you go!

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:20.400
And find lots of tasty food-things!

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:21.270
Scram!

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:24.360
Like you'd ever listen to me...

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:25.570
Meow!

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:32.200
Well, I guess I've got no choice.

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:35.790
So, where's we headin'?

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:39.170
Ikaruga.

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:46.380
Even along this path of brambles on which you must struggle and suffer, and crawl forward to advance,

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:50.130
there is one thing that is certain:

00:22:51.840 --> 00:22:56.560
When the new world was born, hope was born at the same time.

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:02.480
No matter what happens, move forward without giving up,

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:04.980
Ragna the Bloodedge.
